title: "Early gradient spectra for low-rank adaptation"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Ruge Lin"
abstract: >-
  Research checkpoint for activation-whitened
  early-gradient spectra as diagnostics for useful LoRA rank, with controlled
  matrix simulations, synthetic-transformer allocation tests, and scoped
  GPT-2/WikiText-2 validation.
